        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the Hour of Ch'ou... Who won this round?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Count for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you I'm not very good at this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you should learn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is not easy to meet you face-to-face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "A decrepit temple... just as unrelenting as you are. You lock yourself away in this hut to stare at that board day after day. What do you see, looking at it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less what you see from your ledgers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "There exist rules on the board, just as there exist rules outside the board.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All under Heaven live for profit, and die for profit... Perceptive as always, Erge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over the years, our brothers and sisters seem to have lived much more pleasant lives after discovering their interests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our eldest brother seems to have eventually mastered kung fu and made his way north to guard the city there. Our eldest sister, on the other hand, dreamt a thousand years away and roamed hither and thither, living a most happy life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of us live as happily as we can be... except her, you know the one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these years... and I still feel sorry for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Business must've been going very well for you to have the time and luxury to worry about all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't until recently that I comprehended a certain wisdom and learnt a way to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heaven and earth are merely a temporary lodging for all beings, while time is a transient guest that passes generations by...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Man spends an entire lifetime, only for a spiritual lodging and a persistant pursuit for accomplishments. Whether this lifetime is long or short makes little difference.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you were truly seeing everything through, you wouldn't be sitting here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you're going to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can help you do what you want to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I will need to borrow something from you in return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're my second-eldest brother, no need to stand on ceremony. What's mine is yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me your life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
