        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "From what I've heard, I came to Dahuang from the villages outside.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "That year, someone found a wooden basin in the fields with a child who barely knew how to speak. Most likely, he had drifted into the fields from the river that flowed outside the city. Good thing someone found him.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Considering there was news of a Catastrophe, it's not so difficult to make guesses as to what had happened upstream.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a lucky boy, clinging on to dear life in a field of grain... We'll call you He Sheng, for 'Grain Stalks.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "This will be your home from now on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "35_mini01_villagevacancy",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I later asked around, in hopes of finding the village where I was born.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I found a 'village' that was completely empty. There was nothing but ruined houses and swaths of land covered in Originium crystals.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "What happened to the people here?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The land here yields no harvest anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Why...?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you see the black rocks? You can't grow food anywhere you find them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if you can't grow food, people go hungry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Is there lots of land like this?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Is there any way we can make these bad rocks disappear, so we can grow food on this land again?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many people have spent many years looking for a way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you like to join them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Yes...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It could take a very long time. You might never see the results. Even after spending your whole life on the effort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you regret that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "No.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g2_desertedcityfield_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_rain",
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rainlight_loop",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A lot has happened lately. The land I knew is now completely different. The old fields were almost renovated. Too bad Heaven is cruel and forced these endless calamities upon us."
    },
    {
        "text": "The farmer by the fields looks up to see the rain falling onto his face. It feels cool and gentle."
    },
    {
        "text": "The withered crops in the field also stand up straight, their stalks and leaves returning to a crisp, green color."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1249_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Astonished Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shennong...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Astonished Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shennong really is back...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Astonished Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g4_factory_outside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wei, what're you doing, lying around here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wake up. Hey, wake up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "And why that getup again...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What time is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been half a day since we last saw each other. You had me check the crops in the granary, and said you'd find the culprit behind all the storms in Dahuang. Why are you lying here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what's the story?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are the crops in the granary? Were they polluted? Have you found the source of the pollution?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw none of that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went to the granary, only to find the summer harvest all turned a strange red-black color... Not only that, but the soil in the fields is all crusty and salted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no idea what happened, but it rained just moments ago, and not only did the soil return to normal, but so did the grains in the granary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Almost like somebody used some tremendous Originium Arts to cleanse the taint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The taint underground? Who could do that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So we're safe now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "This rain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is Shu?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is... who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your teacher! Where is she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have a few teachers at the Tianshi Bureaus... Which one are you talking about...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
