    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you lost your marbles?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not only do you and the weiqi failure want to get yourselves killed, you wanna drag all of us down with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like my little sisters have spent too much time and had too much fun in this mortal realm... to the point that they've forgotten who they really are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much longer will you two keep up this act, pretending you're not different?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
