    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dusk... you've been hiding in your paintings for so long, yet you are still as impatient as ever. Quite unbecoming of the world's greatest artist, wouldn't you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Nian. In all these years, I've never seen you so serious. Seems you actually care a lot about your siblings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to kill you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "150,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as I told you, I am here to help... *cough*... Why won't you believe me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you want to assemble this vessel of yours that will bear the energy of our existence? The <i>Feranmut's Heart?</i> May I tell you what it's missing right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay back, if you value your life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really don't have the luxury of resolving this misunderstanding right now... You two will just have to forgive me for this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
