    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How come you can control the device? When did you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our powers came from the same source. On top of that, I deliberately studied a few methods of dealing with my doppelgangers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_defboost",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1",
        "bstart": 0.3,
        "bend": 0.6,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "bstart": 0.3,
        "bend": 0.6,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This might perhaps be a little risky and it comes with certain side effects, but that is something I will have to live with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dahuang should face this crisis. They should not be allowed to rely on others giving their lives to resolve what they have sown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That would simply be too convenient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man extends his hand, and a black bundle of rice stalks appears in his hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Shape,' 'will,' and 'causality.' The three of you together may appear as though you can stand up to even Heaven itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is how our sister has always been. She believed that toiling away in the fields would always yield a good harvest. She believed the lands had more beauty than blemishes, more benevolence than wickedness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "But why does the birth of new life always come with the sound of crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "When a frail new life is born on these lands, be it man or beast, the very first emotion it must feel is always fear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is time to wake up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The man inserts the black rice stalks into the enormous device in front of him."
    },
    {
        "text": "Moments later, a heart begins to beat."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hvygnthrtbt",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a"
